# ThreadSanitizer suppressions. Only third-party libraries that are not built with TSan:
# TSan can't see their internal synchronization, so it reports false positives inside them.
# Our own code (and the queue/pool/pipeline tests) is fully checked.

# OpenCV runs its parallel_for on Intel TBB; reports were races between two TBB worker threads.
race:libtbb.so
# OpenCV's image decoding loads GDAL, which takes its own mutexes in an order TSan flags.
deadlock:libgdal.so
